.TH XD\-USERS 1 2026-10-18 XeonDesktop "XeonDesktop Manual"
.SH NAME
xd\-users \- User Accounts
.SH SYNOPSIS
.SY xd\-users
.YS
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xd\-users
is Windows XP's User Accounts (Control Panel), through AccountsService
.RB ( org.freedesktop.Accounts ).
As in XP, it is a set of task pages: pick a task or an account, then what
to change about it.
.PP
Users change their own name and picture, and their password through
.BR passwd (1),
so the system's password rules apply.
Administrators also change other accounts' names, pictures, passwords and
types, create accounts and delete them; AccountsService asks polkit, so
.BR xd\-polkit (1)
asks for an administrator's password.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.face
A copy of the user's picture, which the Start menu shows.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xd\-security (1),
.BR passwd (1)
